course: dictionary
lesson: 8593
title: Scorch: burn, heat or mark
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: To scorch something is to burn its surface a little, so it turns brown or black. Scorch can also be a noun: a scorch is a small burnt mark, like a scorch mark on a table. Look at the words around it to tell which meaning fits.
explain: «The porch boards were scorched.» The boards are not gone, and nobody says they are broken. Scorched means their surface was burnt, so they look brown or black in places. The sentence before it says the dog hid for a whole day, so the clues point to something frightening, not a fire that destroyed everything.
explain: «Hot deserts are scorching by day but can be cold at night.» Here scorching means very, very hot. Swap your meaning into the sentence: hot deserts are very hot by day. It still makes sense, so you have the right meaning. The word «by day» and the word «cold» are the clues.
fact: To scorch something is to burn its surface a little, so it turns brown or black.
fact: «Scorching hot» means very hot.
fact: A scorch, or scorch mark, is a small burnt mark.
fact: The sun can scorch grass or plants, drying them out.
fact: Scorch is a verb (scorch, scorches, scorched, scorching) and also a noun (a scorch, scorches).
exercise: «The porch boards were scorched.» What does scorched mean here? | Painted bright blue | Made very wet | Washed clean with soap and water | *Burnt a little, so they turn brown or black
exercise: «Hot deserts are scorching by day.» What does scorching mean here? | Very quiet | Very cold | *Very hot | Very wet
exercise: A small burnt mark on a table is called a what? | *a scorch | a cable | a plug | a socket
test: The sun can ___ the grass, drying it out. Which word fits? | scoop | score | scold | *scorch
test: «Animals lift their feet off scorching sand.» What does scorching sand mean? | Very cold sand | Wet, muddy sand | *Very hot sand | Soft, quiet sand
exam: «Tell an adult if a socket is broken or scorched.» Why should you tell an adult if a socket is scorched? | *It may be unsafe and needs an adult or electrician | You need to paint it | Scorched sockets are new and shiny | Sockets are a kind of game
